  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C. Line an oven tray with baking paper. Cut the unpeeled potatoes into 2cm-thick wedges. Thinly slice the spring onion. Cut the tomato into 1cm chunks. Drain and rinse the beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/394101/photos/large/62652_1-163af143f4af016c285c74e1aadccd6f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast potato wedges: Put the potato on the lined tray. Drizzle with 1 tbs olive oil, scatter over 2 tsp Mexican spice blend (see Make it yours), season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Roast for 20 mins or until golden and tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/394102/photos/large/62652_2-eabf6818ad6e946a119e4a683b69f722.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add beans: Put the beans and 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl, season with salt and pepper and toss to combine. Scatter the beans over the potato wedges and roast for a further 5 mins or until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/394103/photos/large/62652_3-62d7c7671d4e8ee0780edfe57015e929.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make spring onion cheese: Combine half the cream cheese, half the spring onion and 1 tbs water in a bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/394104/photos/large/62652_4-0cdbeff7e1f4cc164323ffa961ed2552.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the potato and beans among bowls, spoon over with the cream cheese mixture and scatter over the tomato and remaining spring onion. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/394105/photos/large/62652_5-c6ffd869463f9f1e7be04f459ee029e7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: The Mexican spice blend contains chilli, so add more or less to taste, depending on your palate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/394106/photos/large/62652_6-7a8445e434556071504be87c9ddaa031.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
